{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ ܠܣܝܡܬ‌ܐ ܕܒܝܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܪܡܸܢ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܓܪܝܼܫܸܢܘܼܟ݂ ܡ̣ܢ ܓܘܼܒܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܵܐ ܡܘܼܚܕܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܠܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈ ܒܝܼܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܩܘܸܚ ܠܝܼ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂ ܘܩܵܡ ܒܲܣܡܸܬ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡܘܼܐܣܸܩ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܠܓܵܢܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܫܝܘܿܠܔ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܚܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܸܠܝܼ ܡܓܵܘ ܨܵܠܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܓܘܼܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܡܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܟܫܝܼܛܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܫܲܟܪܘܼܢ ܠܕܟ݂ܵܪܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܩܵܐ ܚܕܵܐ ܛܲܪܦܲܛܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܚܸܡܬܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܩܵܐ ܡܸܬܚܵܐ ܕܚܲܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܒܘܼܣܵܡܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܪܲܡܫܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܥܲܪܩܸܠܔ ܒܸܟ݂ܝܵܐ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܒܨܲܦܪܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܐܵܬܝܵܐ ܫܲܒܲܚܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܐܵܢܵܐ ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ ܒܫܸܠܝܘܼܬ‌ܝܼ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܹܢ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܨܸܒ݂ܝܵܢܘܼܟ݂ ܡܘܼܥܒܸܕ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܛܘܼܪܝܼ ܕܟܵܠܹܐ ܚܲܝܠܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܛܘܼܫܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܦܵܬܘܼܟ݂ ܘܦܝܼܫ ܠܝܼ ܫܥܝܼܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܩܪܹܐ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܢܘܼܢܹܐ ܠܝܼ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܡܘܼܕܝܼ ܝܘܼܬܪܵܢܵܐ ܐܝܼܬ ܒܡܵܘܬ‌ܝܼ ܟܲܕ ܨܵܠܹܝܢ ܓܵܘ ܓܘܼܒܵܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܸܪܘܼܟ݂ ܥܲܦܪܵܐ؟ ܗܵܐ، ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܸܥ ܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܫܡܹܥ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܘܪܲܚܸܡ ܥܲܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܗܘܝܼ ܗܲܝܸܪܵܢܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܚܕܸܪܘܼܟ݂ ܐܸܒ݂ܠܝܼ ܠܪܸܩܕܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܘܼܠܸܚ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܣܲܩܝܼ ܘܩܵܡ ܡܲܠܒܸܫܸܬ ܠܝܼ ܚܲܕܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܐ ܕܙܵܡܪܵܐ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂ ܓܵܢܝܼ ܘܠܵܐ ܫܵܬܩܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ، ܠܥܵܠܲܡ ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}